<title>THAILAND: Krungthai Thanakit pays 2.00 baht div.</title>
<headline>Krungthai Thanakit pays 2.00 baht div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00   vs    2.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 March 18, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 23, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Krungthai Thanakit Plc, a finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
